description = "A porcelain colossus of the Convergence, half-woken: a fractured clock-face core ringed by orbiting seconds-glyph shards, one magenta eye beside one hollow socket. It rises when disturbed and keeps time for no one. Half-corrupted -- the Bloom has a finger in its works."
